2025-01-21T20:05:05 |Subject: [PATCH] Delete totally bogus code specifically targetted at mandoc
2025-01-21T20:05:05 | which tried to figure out whether mandoc supported UTF-8 output (which it has
2025-01-21T20:05:06 | been doing since 2011) and which passed the -T locale option (which has been
2025-01-21T20:05:06 | the default since 2014 and always will) but which required the -V option to
