2025-01-21T20:05:06 | it is safe to assume that mandoc just works with UTF-8 on both the input and
2025-01-21T20:05:06 | output sides - in literally each and every operating system providing a
2025-01-21T20:05:06 | mandoc port or package, even those that are seriously lagging behind. This
2025-01-21T20:05:06 | patch will also be pushed upstream. OK tb@
